            <div xml:id="d438">

                <pb facs="0815" n="695" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg695"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4314: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-04-29T15:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29,
                                1922—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 29—9:20
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>177. I recommend that regiment at Tientsin be brought up to strength authorized
                    in new organization which would require an addition of 375 men. This is
                    recommended by commander expeditionary force, military attaché and naval
                    attaché.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
